    },
    "A device nearby asked to pair.": {
      "comment": "配对窗口首行；附近的未命名设备请求配对",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "附近的一台设备请求配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A device on this Mac asked to pair.": {
      "comment": "配对窗口首行；本机的未命名设备请求配对",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 上的一台设备请求配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A device on this network asked to pair.": {
      "comment": "配对窗口首行；未命名设备通过本地网络请求配对",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个网络上的一台设备请求配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A nightly build installs only when you click Update Now.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区脚注：每夜构建版只能点“立即更新”安装",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每夜构建版只有在你点按“立即更新”时才会安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A paired device can see and control this Mac on your network, nearby, and from afar while Remote Access is on. If one is lost, remove it here.": {
      "comment": "设备面板页脚中配对权限的说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已配对设备可通过你的网络或在附近查看和控制这台 Mac，远程访问开启时也可从远处访问。如果设备丢失，请在这里将它移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A paired device can see and control this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已配对设备可查看和控制这台 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A stop signed with Sill’s update key names Sill %@, so Sill won’t install it.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：开发者用更新密钥签名的停用通知停掉了该版本；插值为版本号",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有一份用 Sill 的更新密钥签名的停用通知点名了 Sill %@，所以 Sill 不会安装它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A wrong code came from %@. %@ tries left.": {
      "comment": "配对码错误警告；插值为错误请求来源及剩余次数",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "A wrong code came from %1$@. %2$@ tries left."
