          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An iPhone or iPad Needs Sill Updated": {
      "comment": "状态菜单旧版设备提醒标题",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 或 iPad 需要更新 Sill"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An update of Sill didn’t finish: the new version didn’t start the first time, and Sill’s watcher couldn’t leave a whole copy of Sill in its place. If this copy misbehaves, download Sill again from getsill.app.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：更新没有完成，新版没能启动，守护进程也没能留下完整的 Sill",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 的更新没有完成：新版本第一次没能启动，Sill 的守护程序也没能在原处留下一份完整的 Sill。如果这份 Sill 运行不正常，请从 getsill.app 重新下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another copy of Sill is running. Quit it first, then update.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：还有另一个 Sill 副本在运行",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另一份 Sill 正在运行。请先退出它，再更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another user is on this Mac’s screen. Devices see this account, and can’t click or type in it.": {
      "comment": "状态卡副标题，另一位用户正在使用屏幕时设备只能查看本账户",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另一位用户正在使用这台 Mac 的屏幕。设备看到的是此账户，且无法在其中点按或输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another user is on this Mac’s screen. You’re seeing your account’s own desktop and windows, not the screen. Taps, keys and opening apps wait until your account is back on it.": {
      "comment": "设置面板与应用抽屉里的说明：另一位用户在使用 Mac 屏幕时的只读视图",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另一位用户正在使用这台 Mac 的屏幕。你看到的是你账户自己的桌面和窗口，不是屏幕上的画面。轻点、按键和打开应用要等你的账户回到屏幕上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another user started controlling this Mac.": {
      "comment": "用户切换覆盖层标题",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另一位用户开始控制这台 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another user started controlling this Mac. Log in to your account to reactivate screen sharing with Sill.": {
      "comment": "应用抽屉和设置中的用户切换提示",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另一位用户开始控制这台 Mac。请登录你的账户，以重新启用 Sill 屏幕共享。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any device on your network (or nearby, with Direct Wireless Connection on) and any app on this Mac can see and control it without pairing. Connections are still encrypted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你网络上的任何设备（开启无线直连时也包括附近设备）以及这台 Mac 上的任何应用，都可无需配对便查看和控制它。连接仍会加密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anyone on the internet can now reach port %@ and try to connect. Sill turns away every device you haven’t paired. Turning this off doesn’t close the port on your router: remove the forward there too.": {
      "comment": "远程访问面板中开放互联网连接的说明；插值为端口号",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "互联网上的任何人现在都可访问端口 %@ 并尝试连接。Sill 会拒绝所有未配对的设备。关闭此项不会关闭路由器上的端口：你还需要在路由器上移除端口转发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approve Sill in System Settings › Login Items": {
      "comment": "状态菜单登录启动待批准说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在系统设置 › 登录项中批准 Sill"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approve in System Settings…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在系统设置中批准…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asking your router…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在询问你的路由器…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AudioConverterNew failed (%@%@)": {
      "comment": "音频状态：编码器步骤失败，插值为系统状态码及其字符形式",
