      }
    },
    "Balanced": {
      "comment": "Mac 画质预设名称\n画质预设显示名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "均衡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before it installs a new version, Sill checks it two ways: it must carry Apple’s signature and notarization for Sill’s developer, and a release must be signed with Sill’s own update key; a nightly build is signed by GitHub, which builds it.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区脚注：安装前的两项检查（含每夜构建版）",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 在安装新版本前会做两项检查：它必须带有 Apple 为 Sill 开发者签发的签名和公证，并且正式版必须用 Sill 自己的更新密钥签名；每夜构建版则由构建它的 GitHub 签名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before it installs a new version, Sill checks it two ways: it must carry Apple’s signature and notarization for Sill’s developer, and the release must be signed with Sill’s own update key.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区脚注：安装前的两项检查",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 在安装新版本前会做两项检查：它必须带有 Apple 为 Sill 开发者签发的签名和公证，并且正式版必须用 Sill 自己的更新密钥签名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beta. Devices play the sound of what you stream: all of the streamed window’s app, or every app for the Desktop. The Mac keeps playing it too. A connected iPhone or iPad can also turn this on or off from Sill’s settings there, and mute it for itself alone. Nothing is recorded.": {
      "comment": "串流设置中的测试版音频说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试版。设备会播放串流内容的声音：窗口串流会播放该窗口所属应用的全部声音，桌面串流则会播放所有应用的声音。Mac 也会继续播放。已连接的 iPhone 或 iPad 也可在其 Sill 设置中开启或关闭此项，以及仅将自身静音。不会录制任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CGVirtualDisplay applySettings: returned NO (mode rejected)": {
      "comment": "虚拟显示器设置：显示模式被系统拒绝",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
