    "Devices can’t connect: Sill couldn’t use its key in your keychain (%@). Quit Sill and open it again, and choose Always Allow if the keychain asks.": {
      "comment": "设备面板连接不可用的警告；插值为钥匙串故障原因",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备无法连接：Sill 无法使用你钥匙串中的密钥（%@）。请退出 Sill 后重新打开；如果钥匙串询问，请选择“始终允许”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
