    "Each device asks for its own screen’s rate, up to this limit. Quality is per 60 fps; a 120 fps stream gets twice as much.": {
      "comment": "串流设置页脚：设备帧率上限与画质码率",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每台设备会按自身屏幕的帧率请求串流，但不超过此上限。画质以 60 fps 为基准；120 fps 串流的码率为其两倍。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each device asks for its own screen’s rate, up to this limit. Quality is per 60 fps; a 120 fps stream gets twice as much. %@ Changes apply at once: the current stream restarts for a moment.": {
      "comment": "串流设置页脚；插值为高速网络质量提示",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每台设备会按自身屏幕的帧率请求串流，但不超过此上限。画质以 60 fps 为基准；120 fps 串流的码率为其两倍。%@ 更改会立即生效，当前串流会短暂重启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each iPhone or iPad pairs once: over the USB cable by itself, or on Wi‑Fi with a code this Mac shows when the device asks. Everything devices send and receive is encrypted.": {
      "comment": "设备面板中配对方式和加密的说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每台 iPhone 或 iPad 只需配对一次：通过 USB 线缆自动配对，或通过 Wi‑Fi 使用这台 Mac 在设备请求配对时显示的配对码配对。设备收发的所有数据都会加密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit": {
      "comment": "主菜单：编辑菜单",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Efficient": {
      "comment": "Mac 画质预设名称\n画质预设显示名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "省流"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Extreme": {
      "comment": "Mac 画质预设名称\n画质预设显示名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "极致"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find": {
      "comment": "编辑菜单：查找子菜单",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查找"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find Next": {
      "comment": "查找菜单：下一处",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查找下一处"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find Previous": {
      "comment": "查找菜单：上一处",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查找上一处"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find…": {
      "comment": "查找菜单：打开查找栏",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查找…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Firewall": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "防火墙"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a Mac you reach only through Sill. While another user, or the login window, is on this Mac’s screen, devices see this account’s own desktop and windows instead of nothing: not what the screen shows, and nothing they tap or type reaches this account until it’s back on the screen.": {
      "comment": "设备面板：“另一位用户在使用屏幕时显示此账户”的说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适用于只能通过 Sill 访问的 Mac。当另一位用户或登录窗口正占用这台 Mac 的屏幕时，设备看到的是此账户自己的桌面和窗口，而不是一片空白：这并不是屏幕上显示的画面，而且在此账户回到屏幕上之前，设备上的任何轻点或输入都不会作用于此账户。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forward TCP port %@ on your router to this Mac (%@), and reserve that address for this Mac in the router’s settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Forward TCP port %1$@ on your router to this Mac (%2$@), and reserve that address for this Mac in the router’s settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将路由器上的 TCP 端口 %@ 转发到这台 Mac（%@），并在路由器设置中为这台 Mac 保留该地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frame Rate": {
      "comment": "状态菜单帧率标题",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帧率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frame rate limit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帧率上限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "General": {
      "comment": "设置窗口：通用标签页",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Getting %@ from GitHub…": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：正在从 GitHub 获取更新；插值为版本名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在从 GitHub 获取 %@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GitHub sees this Mac’s IP address and which version of Sill it has; nothing else is sent.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区脚注：GitHub 能看到的信息",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub 能看到这台 Mac 的 IP 地址和它所用的 Sill 版本，除此之外不会发送任何信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GitHub’s answer doesn’t say when the release was published": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：自动更新不安装的原因，GitHub 没说明发布时间（接在“Sill 没有自动安装……：”之后）",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub 的回复没有说明这个正式版的发布时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GitHub’s answer doesn’t say which release it is": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：自动更新不安装的原因，GitHub 没说明是哪个发布（接在“Sill 没有自动安装……：”之后）",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub 的回复没有说明这是哪一个正式版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GitHub’s latest release is no longer Sill %@. Check again.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：GitHub 上最新的正式版已不是所提供的那个；插值为版本号",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub 上最新的正式版已不再是 Sill %@。请再检查一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GitHub’s newest nightly is no longer %@. Check again.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：GitHub 上最新的每夜构建版已不是所提供的那个；插值为版本名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub 上最新的每夜构建版已不再是 %@。请再检查一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hardware Encoder Busy": {
      "comment": "状态菜单硬件编码器忙碌提醒",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "硬件编码器繁忙"
          }
        }
