      }
    },
    "High": {
      "comment": "Mac 画质预设名称\n画质预设显示名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IPv6": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IPv6"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If your iPhone or iPad can’t find this Mac, allow Sill in Privacy & Security › Local Network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果你的 iPhone 或 iPad 找不到这台 Mac，请在“隐私与安全性”›“本地网络”中允许 Sill 访问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If your router has a dynamic DNS name, enter it so your devices keep finding this Mac when your internet address changes. Add :port if the router forwards a different outside port.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果你的路由器有动态 DNS 域名，请输入该域名，这样互联网地址变化时，设备仍能找到这台 Mac。如果路由器转发的外部端口不同，请加上 :port。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Sill on your iPhone or iPad, tap this Mac, or tap Add a Mac… when you’re away, then point it at this code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iPhone 或 iPad 上打开 Sill，轻点这台 Mac；外出时则轻点“添加 Mac…”，然后将设备对准此配对码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Now": {
      "comment": "设置更新区按钮：立即安装",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "立即安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install and Disconnect": {
      "comment": "设置更新区按钮：安装并断开设备",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装并断开连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installing": {
      "comment": "状态菜单副标题：正在安装",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installing %@…": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：正在安装更新；插值为版本名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在安装 %@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installing it restarts Sill and disconnects %@.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：安装会重启 Sill 并断开设备；插值为设备名称列表",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装会重启 Sill，并断开 %@ 的连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installs by itself while no device is connected": {
      "comment": "状态菜单副标题：没有设备连接时自动安装",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有设备连接时会自动安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Internet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "互联网"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It isn’t available right now.": {
      "comment": "设备菜单：暂时不可用提示",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目前不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It paired by itself over the USB cable, and can connect over Wi‑Fi and nearby from now on too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它已通过 USB 线缆自动配对，今后也可以通过 Wi‑Fi 或在附近直连。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It tried to connect with an older Sill.": {
      "comment": "状态菜单旧版设备提醒说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它尝试使用旧版 Sill 连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its windows come back once it is unlocked.": {
      "comment": "未配对设备的锁屏覆盖层说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解锁后，它的窗口就会重新出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last checked %@.": {
      "comment": "设置更新检查：插值为上次检查日期",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次检查时间：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last window": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次串流的窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Launch at Login": {
      "comment": "状态菜单登录启动标题",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录时打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Launch at login": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录时打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets Sill capture the windows you pick on your iPhone or iPad, and their sound when Send Audio is on. Nothing is recorded or saved; frames and sound go straight to your devices.": {
      "comment": "屏幕录制权限说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许 Sill 捕捉你在 iPhone 或 iPad 上选择的窗口，以及开启“发送声音”时这些窗口的声音。画面和声音会直接传送到你的设备，不会录制或保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets the iPhone and iPad you pair connect to this Mac from other networks: through a VPN such as Tailscale, or through a port you forward on your router. Sill turns away every device you haven’t paired, and encrypts everything the paired ones send and receive.": {
      "comment": "远程访问面板页脚中连接方式和加密的说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让已配对的 iPhone 和 iPad 从其他网络连接这台 Mac：可以通过 Tailscale 等 VPN，或通过路由器上转发的端口连接。Sill 会拒绝所有未配对的设备，并加密已配对设备收发的所有数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets your iPhone and iPad connect when they’re near this Mac, even without a shared Wi‑Fi network, the way AirDrop does. While it’s on, this Mac’s Wi‑Fi keeps stepping away from your network, so streaming over Wi‑Fi can stutter. Anyone nearby with Sill can find this Mac; only devices you paired can connect, unless Require pairing is off.": {
      "comment": "通用设置中直接无线连接的说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让你的 iPhone 和 iPad 在这台 Mac 附近时，无需连接同一 Wi‑Fi 网络也能连接，原理与 AirDrop 相同。开启后，这台 Mac 的 Wi‑Fi 会不断短暂离开当前网络，因此通过 Wi‑Fi 串流时可能会卡顿。附近任何使用 Sill 的人都能找到这台 Mac；除非关闭“需要配对”，否则只有已配对的设备才能连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets your iPhone or iPad click, scroll and type on this Mac, and lets Sill move and size the window it streams.": {
      "comment": "辅助功能权限说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让你的 iPhone 或 iPad 在这台 Mac 上点按、滚动和输入文字，并允许 Sill 移动和调整正在串流的窗口大小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local Network": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本地网络"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Locked": {
      "comment": "状态菜单：Mac 已锁定",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已锁定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Log in to your account to reactivate screen sharing with Sill.": {
      "comment": "用户切换覆盖层的登录说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录你的账户，以重新启用 Sill 屏幕共享。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Low": {
      "comment": "Mac 画质预设名称\n画质预设显示名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "低"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lower latency when the Mac is busy, at a softer picture.": {
      "comment": "串流设置中优先编码速度的说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Mac 繁忙时降低延迟，但画面会更模糊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Minimize": {
      "comment": "窗口菜单：最小化",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最小化"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needed to show your windows on your devices.": {
      "comment": "状态菜单屏幕录制权限说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要此权限才能在你的设备上显示窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs Accessibility": {
      "comment": "虚拟显示设置中的状态：缺少辅助功能权限",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要辅助功能权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs Screen Recording": {
      "comment": "虚拟显示设置中的状态：缺少屏幕录制权限",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要屏幕录制权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs Screen Recording and Accessibility": {
      "comment": "虚拟显示设置中的状态：缺少屏幕录制和辅助功能权限",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要屏幕录制和辅助功能权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs attention": {
      "comment": "状态菜单警告图标的辅助功能说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要处理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New Code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新配对码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nightly builds are built and signed by GitHub from Sill’s newest code; nobody looks at them first. They are less tested than releases and may break. Sill tells you when one is out, and Update Now installs it; a nightly never installs by itself, even with Automatically update Sill on. Turning this off doesn’t go back to the last release: Sill keeps the nightly you have until a release that is at least as new.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：“使用每夜构建版”开启时的说明（信任、风险和只能点“立即更新”安装）",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每夜构建版由 GitHub 根据 Sill 最新的代码构建并签名，事先没有人审看。它们的测试不如正式版充分，可能会出问题。每夜构建版发布时 Sill 会告诉你，并由“立即更新”来安装；即使开启了“自动更新 Sill”，每夜构建版也不会自行安装。关闭此项并不会退回上一个正式版：在出现至少同样新的正式版之前，Sill 会保留你现有的每夜构建版。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No VPN is running on this Mac. Install one such as Tailscale on this Mac and on your iPhone or iPad, or allow connections from the internet below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 上没有正在运行的 VPN。请在这台 Mac 和你的 iPhone 或 iPad 上安装 Tailscale 等 VPN，或在下方允许来自互联网的连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No paired devices yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚无已配对的设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No shared network needed; Wi‑Fi streams can stutter": {
      "comment": "状态菜单直接无线连接说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
