    "Once a day, Sill asks GitHub whether a newer version is out.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区脚注：每天一次向 GitHub 询问新版本",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 每天会向 GitHub 询问一次是否有新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a day, Sill asks GitHub whether a newer version is out. GitHub sees this Mac’s IP address and which version of Sill it has; nothing else is sent. Sill never downloads or installs anything by itself: a new version opens its page on GitHub, where you download it.": {
      "comment": "设置更新检查：自动检查的隐私与下载方式说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 每天会向 GitHub 查询一次是否有新版本。GitHub 会看到这台 Mac 的 IP 地址和 Sill 版本，除此之外不会发送任何信息。Sill 不会自行下载或安装任何内容：发现新版本时会打开其 GitHub 页面，由你下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a day, and with nightly builds on each time Sill opens, Sill asks GitHub whether a newer version is out.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区脚注：每天一次（开启每夜构建版时每次打开也会）向 GitHub 询问新版本",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 每天会向 GitHub 询问一次是否有新版本；开启每夜构建版后，每次打开 Sill 时也会询问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only needed for a port forward on your router. A VPN is simpler and keeps this Mac off the open internet.": {
      "comment": "远程访问面板中关闭互联网连接的说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在路由器上设置端口转发时需要。使用 VPN 更简单，也能避免将这台 Mac 暴露在公共互联网上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
