    "Sill %@ didn’t start the first time, and the copy it replaced failed its last check, so Sill %@ stayed. If it misbehaves, download Sill again from getsill.app.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：新版没能启动，旧副本又没通过最后检查，所以保留了当前版本；插值为当前版本号（两处）",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Sill %1$@ didn’t start the first time, and the copy it replaced failed its last check, so Sill %2$@ stayed. If it misbehaves, download Sill again from getsill.app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill %1$@ 第一次没能启动，被它替换的旧副本又没能通过最后一次检查，所以保留了 Sill %2$@。如果运行不正常，请从 getsill.app 重新下载 Sill。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
