    },
    "Sill %@ isn’t signed with Sill’s update key yet, so it can’t be installed from here. Try again later, or open its release page.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：正式版尚未用更新密钥签名；插值为版本号",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill %@ 尚未用 Sill 的更新密钥签名，所以无法从这里安装。请稍后再试，或打开它的发布页面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill %@. The picture is unaffected.": {
      "comment": "串流设置中的音频警告；插值为音频故障说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill：%@。画面不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill Couldn’t Start": {
      "comment": "状态卡标题，启动失败",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 无法启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill Log": {
      "comment": "日志窗口：窗口标题",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 日志"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill appears on your iPhone and iPad once this Mac is on Wi-Fi or Ethernet and Local Network access is allowed.": {
      "comment": "状态卡等待网络说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 连接到 Wi‑Fi 或以太网并获得本地网络访问权限后，Sill 就会显示在你的 iPhone 和 iPad 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill at %@ changed since it started. Quit Sill and open it again.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：Sill 自启动后文件已变化，插值为路径",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "位于 %@ 的 Sill 在启动后发生了变化。请退出 Sill 并重新打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill belongs to another account on this Mac (%@). Update it from that account.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：Sill 属于这台 Mac 上的另一个账户，插值为账户名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 属于这台 Mac 上的另一个账户（%@）。请在那个账户中更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill changed on disk since it started. Quit Sill and open it again, then update.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：Sill 自启动后磁盘上的文件已变化",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 在启动后磁盘上的文件发生了变化。请退出 Sill 并重新打开，然后再更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill couldn’t put %@ back in place. Download Sill again from getsill.app and put it in your Applications folder.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：Sill 没能把旧版放回原处，也没有完整的旧副本；插值为旧版本号",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 没能把 %@ 放回原处。请从 getsill.app 重新下载 Sill，并放进“应用程序”文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill couldn’t put %@ back in place. It is at %@: quit Sill and move it to your Applications folder soon, as macOS empties that folder after a few days.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：Sill 没能把旧版放回原处，旧副本在临时位置；插值为旧版本号和旧副本所在路径",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Sill couldn’t put %1$@ back in place. It is at %2$@: quit Sill and move it to your Applications folder soon, as macOS empties that folder after a few days."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 没能把 %1$@ 放回原处。它在 %2$@：请尽快退出 Sill 并把它移到“应用程序”文件夹，因为 macOS 会在几天后清空那个文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill couldn’t read what it keeps for this setting, so it is off. Turning it on starts it afresh.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：读不出这项设置保存的内容，所以保持关闭，重新打开会从头开始",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 读不出为此设置保存的内容，所以它处于关闭状态。重新开启会从头开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill couldn’t use its key in your keychain.": {
      "comment": "状态菜单钥匙串异常说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 无法使用你的钥匙串中的密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill couldn’t use its key in your keychain. Quit Sill and open it again, and choose Always Allow if the keychain asks.": {
      "comment": "状态卡钥匙串异常说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 无法使用你的钥匙串中的密钥。请退出并重新打开 Sill；如果钥匙串提示请求访问，请选择“始终允许”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill didn’t install %@ by itself: %@. Update Now still can.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：Sill 没有自动安装该版本；插值为版本号和原因（一个短语）",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Sill didn’t install %1$@ by itself: %2$@. Update Now still can."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 没有自动安装 %1$@：%2$@。仍可点按“立即更新”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill doesn’t check for updates in test pattern mode.": {
      "comment": "设置更新检查：测试图案模式说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 在测试图案模式下不检查更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill downloads and installs nothing by itself. Update Now downloads the new version from GitHub, puts it in place of this copy and restarts Sill; Open Release Page… shows it on GitHub instead.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区脚注：未开启自动更新时的行为",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 不会自行下载或安装任何内容。“立即更新”会从 GitHub 下载新版本，替换这份 Sill 并重启；“打开发布页面…”则会在 GitHub 上显示它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill installs it by itself %@ or later, once no device has been connected for %@.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：将在某时刻或之后自动安装；插值为时刻短语和时长",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Sill installs it by itself %1$@ or later, once no device has been connected for %2$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 会在%1$@或之后自行安装它，前提是已有 %2$@ 没有设备连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill installs it by itself %@, once no device has been connected for %@.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：将在等待一段时间后自动安装；插值为等待时间短语和时长",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Sill installs it by itself %1$@, once no device has been connected for %2$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 会在%1$@自行安装它，前提是已有 %2$@ 没有设备连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill installs it by itself once no device has been connected for %@, then restarts.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：无设备连接一段时间后自动安装并重启；插值为时长（如“5 分钟”）",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一旦已有 %@ 没有设备连接，Sill 就会自行安装它，然后重启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill installs it by itself once no device has been connected for %@.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：无设备连接一段时间后自动安装；插值为时长",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一旦已有 %@ 没有设备连接，Sill 就会自行安装它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill is in a folder this account can’t change (%@).": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：当前账户无权修改 Sill 所在文件夹，插值为文件夹路径",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 所在的文件夹（%@）当前账户无法修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill is on a disk this Mac can’t change (%@).": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：Sill 所在磁盘只读，插值为磁盘名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 所在的磁盘无法被这台 Mac 修改（%@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill is on a network disk (%@), so it doesn’t update itself there.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：Sill 在网络磁盘上，插值为磁盘名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 位于网络磁盘（%@）上，所以不会在那里自行更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill is open in another account on this Mac (%@). Quit it there first, then update.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：另一个账户也在运行 Sill，插值为账户名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 上的另一个账户（%@）正在运行 Sill。请先在那里退出，再更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill is running from a disk image. Copy it to your Applications folder, open it from there, then update.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：Sill 正从磁盘映像运行，需先拷到应用程序文件夹",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 正从磁盘映像运行。请先把它拷到“应用程序”文件夹，再从那里打开，然后更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill is up to date.": {
      "comment": "设置更新检查结果：已是最新版本",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 已是最新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill moves the window you pick onto an invisible display made for your device, so it keeps updating when other windows cover it and text is drawn at your device’s scale. The window leaves this screen while it streams and comes back when you stop streaming or quit Sill.": {
      "comment": "虚拟显示设置中窗口移动行为的说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 会将你选取的窗口移到专为你的设备创建的隐藏显示器上。这样，即使被其他窗口遮挡，窗口也会持续更新，文字也会按你设备的缩放比例绘制。串流时，窗口会移出此屏幕；停止串流或退出 Sill 后，窗口会移回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill nightly %@ (%@)": {
      "comment": "每夜构建版的名称，插值为版本号和构建号",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Sill nightly %1$@ (%2$@)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 每夜构建版 %1$@（%2$@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill runs through a link (%@), so it can’t replace itself there.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：Sill 通过链接运行，插值为路径",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 是通过链接运行的（%@），所以无法在那里替换自身。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill streams at these while every connected device is away from home, through a VPN or over the internet, so a slow connection never starts at your home quality. A device away from home changes these, and never your Quality and Resolution above.": {
      "comment": "异地串流质量说明；当前未使用此质量",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当所有已连接设备都在外出时通过 VPN 或互联网连接时，Sill 会使用这些设置串流，避免较慢的连接以在家时的画质启动。外出时的设备只会修改这些设置，不会更改上方的“画质”和“分辨率”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill streams at these while every connected device is away from home, through a VPN or over the internet, so a slow connection never starts at your home quality. A device away from home changes these, and never your Quality and Resolution above. Streaming at these now.": {
      "comment": "异地串流质量说明；当前正在使用此质量",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当所有已连接设备都在外出时通过 VPN 或互联网连接时，Sill 会使用这些设置串流，避免较慢的连接以在家时的画质启动。外出时的设备只会修改这些设置，不会更改上方的“画质”和“分辨率”。当前正在使用这些设置串流。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill tries again after its next daily check.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：自动更新失败后，下次每日检查时会再试",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 会在下一次每日检查后再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill updated itself to %@ %@.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：Sill 已自动更新到某版本；插值为版本号和时刻短语（如“今天 03:12”）",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Sill updated itself to %1$@ %2$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 已于 %2$@ 自动更新到 %1$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill was just updated. Update Now is ready again in half a minute.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：刚更新完，半分钟后才可再次立即更新",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 刚刚更新过。半分钟后即可再次立即更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill won’t install %@ by itself again; Update Now still can.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：自动更新已试过多次，不再自动安装该版本；插值为版本号",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 不会再自动安装 %@；仍可点按“立即更新”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill won’t install %@ by itself: Sill %@ was out before it. Update Now still can.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：自动更新不装旧版本，因为更高的版本早已发布；插值为所提供的版本号和更高的版本号",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Sill won’t install %1$@ by itself: Sill %2$@ was out before it. Update Now still can."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 不会自动安装 %1$@：在它之前已有 Sill %2$@ 发布。仍可点按“立即更新”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill — %@": {
      "comment": "菜单栏工具提示，插值为当前状态",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill — %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill, %@": {
      "comment": "菜单栏辅助功能标签，插值为当前状态",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill，%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill’s developer stopped Sill %@ with a stop signed with Sill’s update key, so it isn’t installed. %@": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：开发者用更新密钥签名的停用通知停掉了该版本；插值为版本号和“当前版本保持不变”一句",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Sill’s developer stopped Sill %1$@ with a stop signed with Sill’s update key, so it isn’t installed. %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 的开发者用 Sill 的更新密钥签名的停用通知停掉了 Sill %1$@，所以不会安装它。%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sleep": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "睡眠"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Space": {
      "comment": "设备菜单快捷键：空格键名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空格键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Standard": {
      "comment": "状态菜单分辨率选项",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start SillHost with --virtual-display to use it.": {
      "comment": "设备设置：启动主机时启用虚拟显示器",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启动 SillHost 时添加 --virtual-display 参数，即可使用虚拟显示器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting…": {
      "comment": "状态卡标题，正在启动",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在启动…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Status": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stream from a virtual display": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从虚拟显示器串流"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streamed where it is: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在原位置串流：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streaming": {
      "comment": "设置窗口：串流标签页",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "串流"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streaming to %@": {
      "comment": "状态卡串流标题，插值为设备简称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在向 %@ 串流"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streaming to %@ Devices": {
      "comment": "状态卡串流标题，插值为设备数量",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在向 %@ 台设备串流"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streaming to a Device": {
      "comment": "状态卡串流标题，设备名称未知",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在向一台设备串流"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streaming with the software encoder, up to 60 fps, until it is free again.": {
      "comment": "状态菜单编码器忙碌说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂时使用软件编码器串流，最高 60 fps；硬件编码器空闲后会自动切回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streaming with the software encoder, up to 60 fps. Restarting the Mac fixes this.": {
      "comment": "状态菜单编码器卡住说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在使用软件编码器串流，最高 60 fps。重新启动 Mac 可解决此问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test Pattern": {
      "comment": "状态卡串流来源名称，测试图案\n状态菜单：测试画面标题",
      "localizations": {
