    "Test Pattern Mode": {
      "comment": "状态卡标题，测试图案模式",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试图案模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test Tone": {
      "comment": "音频状态：测试音",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text you copy here can be pasted on a connected iPhone or iPad, and text sent from one with Paste becomes this Mac’s.": {
      "comment": "Mac 设置中共享剪贴板的说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在这里拷贝的文字可以粘贴到已连接的 iPhone 或 iPad 上；设备使用“粘贴”发送的文字会进入这台 Mac 的剪贴板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text you copy on %@ is ready to paste on this %@. To paste on %@, copy text here and tap Paste: it goes where %@’s cursor is. With Paste on %@ Right Away off, Paste only puts it on %@’s clipboard.": {
      "comment": "设置中立即粘贴开启时的剪贴板说明，插值为 Mac 名称和设备类型",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Text you copy on %1$@ is ready to paste on this %2$@. To paste on %3$@, copy text here and tap Paste: it goes where %4$@’s cursor is. With Paste on %5$@ Right Away off, Paste only puts it on %6$@’s clipboard."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在 %@ 上拷贝的文字可直接粘贴到这台 %@ 上。要在 %@ 上粘贴，请在这里拷贝文字，再轻点“粘贴”，文字就会粘贴到 %@ 的光标位置。关闭“立即在 %@ 上粘贴”后，“粘贴”只会将文字放入 %@ 的剪贴板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text you copy on %@ is ready to paste on this %@. To paste on %@, copy text here, tap Paste, then press ⌘V there.": {
      "comment": "设置中共享剪贴板开启时的说明，插值为 Mac 名称和设备类型",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Text you copy on %1$@ is ready to paste on this %2$@. To paste on %3$@, copy text here, tap Paste, then press ⌘V there."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在 %@ 上拷贝的文字可直接粘贴到这台 %@ 上。要在 %@ 上粘贴，请在这里拷贝文字，轻点“粘贴”，然后在那里按 ⌘V。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That code didn’t work. Check the code on your Mac. %lld tries left.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "That code didn’t work. Check the code on your Mac. %lld try left."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "That code didn’t work. Check the code on your Mac. %lld tries left."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "配对码不正确。请核对 Mac 上的配对码。还可尝试 %lld 次。"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That doesn’t look like an address. Try home.example.net, or home.example.net:17455.": {
      "comment": "远程访问地址名校验错误",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地址格式似乎不正确。请尝试 home.example.net 或 home.example.net:17455。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac is locked": {
      "comment": "锁屏覆盖层标题，Mac 名称未知",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 已锁定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac is locked, so the text wasn’t typed.": {
      "comment": "语音输入结果：Mac 已锁屏",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 已锁屏，因此未输入文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac is locked.": {
      "comment": "设备菜单：Mac 已锁定提示",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 已锁定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac is locked. Unlock it to see its windows.": {
      "comment": "应用抽屉和设置中的锁屏提示，Mac 名称未知",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 已锁定。解锁后即可查看窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac keeps playing it too": {
      "comment": "状态菜单发送声音说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 也会继续播放声音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The devices you pair in Devices can connect from afar while Remote Access is on.": {
      "comment": "远程访问面板中配对设备连接权限的说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启远程访问后，你在“设备”中配对的设备即可从远处连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The hardware encoder is busy or not answering, so streams use the software encoder: up to 60 fps at Standard resolution. Sill switches back by itself once it keeps up again.": {
      "comment": "串流面板硬件编码器暂不可用的提示",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "硬件编码器正忙或未响应，因此当前使用软件编码器串流：标准分辨率下最高 60 fps。硬件编码器恢复后，Sill 会自动切回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The hardware encoder is stuck, so streams use the software encoder: up to 60 fps at Standard resolution. Restarting the Mac fixes this.": {
      "comment": "串流面板硬件编码器卡住的提示",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "硬件编码器已卡住，串流改用软件编码器：标准分辨率下最高为 60 fps。重新启动 Mac 即可解决。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last recording is still being recognized.": {
      "comment": "语音输入结果：上一段还在识别",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上一段录音仍在识别中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last window streamed where it is: %@": {
      "comment": "设备设置：上次窗口原位串流，插值为失败说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次窗口在原位置串流：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The link can’t carry %@": {
      "comment": "状态卡连接跟不上，插值为画质",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前连接无法支持 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The link can’t carry %@ · RTT %@": {
      "comment": "状态卡连接跟不上，插值为画质和往返延迟",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The link can’t carry %1$@ · RTT %2$@"
          }
        },
