          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前连接无法支持 %@ · 往返延迟 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The login item and the permissions follow this copy of Sill. Keep one copy, in Applications.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录项和权限与这份 Sill 关联。请仅保留一份，并放在“应用程序”中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS firewall blocks %@ and its executable, so devices on the network cannot connect. In Terminal:": {
      "comment": "通用设置：防火墙阻止应用及可执行文件，插值为应用包名",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 防火墙阻止了 %@ 及其可执行文件，因此网络上的设备无法连接。请在终端中执行："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS firewall blocks %@ and its executable.": {
      "comment": "状态菜单：防火墙阻止应用及可执行文件，插值为应用包名",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
