          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS firewall blocks %@.": {
      "comment": "状态菜单：防火墙阻止应用，插值为应用包名",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 防火墙阻止了 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS firewall blocks Sill’s executable, so devices on the network cannot connect. In Terminal:": {
      "comment": "通用设置：防火墙阻止可执行文件",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 防火墙阻止了 Sill 的可执行文件，因此网络上的设备无法连接。请在终端中执行："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS firewall blocks Sill’s executable.": {
      "comment": "状态菜单：防火墙阻止可执行文件",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 防火墙阻止了 Sill 的可执行文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS firewall blocks all incoming connections, so devices on the network cannot connect. Turn off Block all incoming connections in System Settings › Network › Firewall › Options.": {
      "comment": "通用设置：防火墙阻止全部传入连接及解决方法",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 防火墙阻止了所有传入连接，因此网络上的设备无法连接。请在“系统设置 › 网络 › 防火墙 › 选项”中关闭“阻止所有传入连接”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS firewall blocks all incoming connections.": {
      "comment": "状态菜单：防火墙阻止全部传入连接",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 防火墙阻止了所有传入连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The menus changed. Open the menu again.": {
      "comment": "设备菜单：菜单变化提示",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "菜单已更改。请重新打开菜单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recording is too long to send.": {
      "comment": "语音输入结果：录音超过大小上限",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音太长，无法发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recording was empty.": {
      "comment": "语音输入结果：录音为空",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音为空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The streamed window is on the virtual display": {
      "comment": "虚拟显示器菜单副标题，窗口已移至虚拟显示器",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "串流窗口位于虚拟显示器上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then press ⌘V there.": {
      "comment": "剪贴板芯片副标题，提醒在 Mac 上粘贴",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "然后在那里按下 ⌘V。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac": {
      "comment": "远程访问地址列表中的本机地址标签",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac can’t be reached while it’s asleep. While a device is connected from away, Sill keeps it from going to sleep by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 睡眠时无法连接。有设备从外部连接时，Sill 会阻止它自动进入睡眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac doesn’t know that audio format. Update Sill on it.": {
      "comment": "语音输入结果：Mac 不认识设备发来的音频格式",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Mac 不支持该音频格式，请更新 Mac 上的 Sill。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build of Sill has no version number, so it can’t check.": {
      "comment": "设置更新检查：构建没有版本号",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此构建版本的 Sill 没有版本号，因此无法检查更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code expired.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此配对码已过期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code no longer works.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此配对码已失效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This copy of Sill can’t keep this setting: only Sill’s releases from GitHub can.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：此副本无法保存这项设置，只有 GitHub 上的正式版才能",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这份 Sill 无法保存此设置：只有来自 GitHub 的 Sill 正式版才可以。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This copy of Sill isn’t a notarized release, so it can’t update itself.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：此副本不是经过公证的正式版，无法自行更新",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这份 Sill 不是经过公证的正式版，所以无法自行更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the Mac’s name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是 Mac 的名称。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This network. Use it with a VPN into your home network, such as WireGuard on your router.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此网络。请通过 VPN 接入家中网络后使用，例如使用路由器上的 WireGuard。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This nightly installs only when you click Update Now.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：这个每夜构建版只能点“立即更新”安装",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个每夜构建版只有在你点按“立即更新”时才会安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This run checks a test feed, so it doesn’t update itself.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：本次运行使用测试更新源，不会自行更新",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次运行使用的是测试更新源，所以不会自行更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To unlock it from here, type its password and press Return. Its windows come back once it is unlocked.": {
      "comment": "已配对设备的锁屏覆盖层解锁说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要在此处解锁，请输入该 Mac 的密码并按下 Return。解锁后，其窗口就会重新出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too long to send: %@ takes up to %lld KB of text.": {
      "comment": "剪贴板文字过长提示，插值为 Mac 名称和容量上限（KB）",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Too long to send: %1$@ takes up to %2$lld KB of text."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字过长，无法发送：%@ 最多可接收 %lld KB 的文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too many requests. Open the menu again.": {
      "comment": "设备菜单：请求过多提示",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请求过多。请重新打开菜单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again": {
      "comment": "设置更新区按钮：重试更新",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On Remote Access": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启远程访问"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn this on to pair while you use this Mac through Screen Sharing or another remote desktop app, as you would a Mac without a display. While it’s on, anyone who can see this Mac’s screen remotely can read the code. Devices streaming this Mac never show the window.": {
      "comment": "设备面板中向屏幕共享显示配对窗口的说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果你通过屏幕共享或其他远程桌面应用使用这台 Mac，例如使用未连接显示器的 Mac，请开启此设置以进行配对。开启后，任何能远程查看这台 Mac 屏幕的人都能看到配对码。正在串流这台 Mac 的设备始终不会显示此窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ultra": {
      "comment": "Mac 画质预设名称\n画质预设显示名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
