    },
    "You have %@; update it in Settings": {
      "comment": "状态菜单副标题：当前版本，可在设置中更新；插值为当前版本名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你当前使用的是 %@；可在设置中更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have a nightly build, %@ (%@). Sill updates to the next release that is at least as new.": {
      "comment": "设置更新区：关闭每夜构建版后的说明（不会降级）；插值为当前每夜构建版的版本号和构建号",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "You have a nightly build, %1$@ (%2$@). Sill updates to the next release that is at least as new."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你当前使用的是每夜构建版 %1$@（%2$@）。Sill 会更新到下一个至少与它同样新的正式版。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your account’s own desktop, not this Mac’s screen. Taps and keys reach it once your account is back on the screen.": {
      "comment": "串流画面上的提示行：另一位用户在使用 Mac 屏幕时，设备看到的是本账户自己的桌面，只能看",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是你账户自己的桌面，不是这台 Mac 屏幕上的画面。等你的账户回到屏幕上，轻点和按键才会生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your devices can’t reach this Mac through %@ until it connects.": {
      "comment": "远程访问面板中 VPN 离线的说明；插值为 VPN 服务名",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 连接后，你的设备才能通过它访问这台 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your devices learn these when they pair and keep them current whenever they connect.": {
      "comment": "远程访问地址列表页脚中地址同步的说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的设备会在配对时获取这些地址，并在每次连接时更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your iPhone and iPad can dictate into what streams: what they record is recognized by meeppo-voice on this Mac.": {
      "comment": "通用设置：语音输入已连接时的说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你可以在 iPhone 和 iPad 上录音，由此 Mac 上的 meeppo-voice 识别，并将文字输入正在串流的应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your internet provider shares this address among many homes (%@), so a port forward can’t reach this Mac. Use a VPN such as Tailscale instead.": {
      "comment": "远程访问面板中运营商 NAT 的警告；插值为部分隐藏的公网地址",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的互联网服务提供商让多户家庭共用此地址（%@），因此端口转发无法访问这台 Mac。请使用 Tailscale 等 VPN。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your paired devices show here once Sill can use its key again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 恢复使用其密钥后，已配对的设备就会显示在此处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your router didn’t say. You’ll find the address in its settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的路由器未提供地址。你可以在路由器设置中找到它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your router sits behind another router. Forward the port on both, or use a VPN.": {
      "comment": "远程访问面板中双重 NAT 的警告",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的路由器连接在另一台路由器后方。请在两台路由器上都设置端口转发，或使用 VPN。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re all set. Open Sill on your iPhone or iPad.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置已就绪。请在 iPhone 或 iPad 上打开 Sill。"
          }
